{
  "metric": "Route Release Tax",
  "slug": "route_release_tax",
  "definition": "Seconds from snap (t=0) to the first frame where the TE's displacement from his snap position (max of downfield gain, |lateral|) >= RELEASE_MIN_DISP yd AND speed >= RELEASE_MIN_SPEED yd/s for RELEASE_SUSTAIN consecutive frames. Never-released plays are right-censored at t_end (end of dropback/throw frame); per-play tax winsorized at 5.0 s. Player value = mean per-play tax (lower = faster release). RTOE = tax - cross-fit E[tax | context].",
